  <div class="grid grid-2"><div class="card video-card"><iframe class="video-frame" title="How to Create Workiva Wdata Tables Manually" loading="lazy" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/qJIxn7SgPxg" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe><h3>How to create Workiva Wdata tables manually</h3><p>Villani Analytics · demonstrasi pembuatan tabel, data types, dan required fields di UI Wdata (2023). Tutorial pihak ketiga, bukan video resmi Workiva.</p><a class="video-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJIxn7SgPxg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buka video YouTube ↗</a></div><div class="card video-card"><iframe class="video-frame" title="Creating Queries with Workiva Wdata" loading="lazy" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/wvQ8NKTmd44" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe><h3>Creating Queries with Workiva Wdata</h3><p>Villani Analytics · query builder UI, kombinasi tabel, sorting dan filtering tanpa menulis SQL (2023). Tutorial pihak ketiga, bukan video resmi Workiva.</p><a class="video-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wvQ8NKTmd44" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buka video YouTube ↗</a></div></div>
